==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|astrologer}}, {{m|enm|astrologier}}, {{m|enm|astrologere}}, formed from {{der|en|enm|astrologie}} or {{der|en|la|astrologus}} + {{der|en|enm|-ere}}, equivalent to {{af|en|astrology|-er|id2=agent noun}}. Ousted imported {{noncog|enm|astrologien|t=astrologer}}, borrowed from {{noncog|fro|astrologien}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One who studies or practices [[astrology]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|astrologist}}

